ot have a stronger single to lead with. Taking the lead with ♣2 allows us to push with our combinations (like sequences of 7s and 10s, or triplets). We keep BlackJoker in reserve to beat any unexpected high play from landlord.\n\nAnswer:  \n{"cards": ["♣2"]}'}
